{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-06_beg","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-06","title":"临界时刻","storyCode":"15-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d96ef5654c71282fefae23fdedb352c02cb4bc052104fc51573d330c6f5b08ee","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"博士和阿米娅完成了思维共享，并在黑王冠的协助下准备越过“文明的存续”的边界。阿米娅亲眼看到了博士曾经向她讲述的童话。卡特斯感染者见到了深空中的神秘精灵。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ceo"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我从未尝试过利用黑王冠来接触你的思维——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不必紧张，阿米娅。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我已经完全向你敞开我的内心和思维。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她看向了自己的身侧，那一束温柔的白光正轻轻拉着她的手。\n她闭上眼，长舒一口气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我们一起，阿米娅。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我也不知道我们这趟旅程通往何处，但我会保护你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我也会保护你，阿米娅。”\n她在“魔王”的注视下，轻轻触碰着你的额前——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的记忆和情感正向我流淌过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感觉很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明它们的波动如此平静温和，明明记忆的尽头并不遥远......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当初特蕾西娅小姐到底看到了什么——"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅看到你，看到了凯尔希，看到了自己，还有罗德岛上许许多多的人。\n她越走越深，那个记忆的边界已经触手可及。“好奇”与“担忧”致使她几乎忘记了自己的目的，她想要触及那道边界......\n想要触及你记忆的起点。切尔诺伯格，石棺，还有那个虚弱地伸出手的你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"“博士......抓紧我的手！！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好像还有其他的记忆？为什么模糊不清？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_9"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“阿米娅！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"你的手抓住了阿米娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......你迷失了？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我不知道，这也是我第一次如此深入地接触他人的思维，这种感觉......很奇异。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但好在你成功了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，博士，我现在能感受到你每一丝细微的情绪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我也能感受到你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你现在很放松嘛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有阿米娅在，我并不需要担心什么。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"接下来，我们应该怎么做？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，拉紧我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的路，我会保护你走下去的。关于魔王的一切，特蕾西娅小姐在那一天已经全部教给了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那条路的前面，“她”已经在等着我们了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n我理解你的理由，但我无法提供，你的请求违背了DWDB-221E的底层逻辑。\n但我可以提供绕过限制的方法，凯尔希——\n“深潜”。\n可惜连特蕾西娅也无法走到如此遥远的地方，其中的风险远远超过了她所能承受的范围——\n你并不奢求从我这里获得答案？那为何你如此执着于求助我访问这些于你无益的数据？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我无法确认是否终有一天，阿米娅会向你提出同样的问题。但我希望，她能在黑暗中找到我为她照亮的方向。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希便是如此回答我，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......请问您能为我们调出凯尔希医生的所有访问记录吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她每一次的疑惑，每一次的坚持，还有每一次的失落离去，我将无一保留地展示给你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你也曾深入过“文明的存续”，但这一次，你所寻找的东西远在边际之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是泰拉生命暂时无法踏足的领域，但或许你有机会访问那些不属于你们的知识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你的同行者——Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......我？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很快便会知晓我的意思，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随我来吧，阿米娅，来到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g6_crownboundary"},{"type":"narration","text":"“文明奇点”。\n纯白巨型长廊环绕着中央那不可捉摸的点——“奇点”。\n庞杂的信息流不断从奇点中溢出，能够被你们所捕获的信息皆是足以被你们理解的知识。\n阿米娅看不到来时的路。但要是沿着长廊继续走下去，在浪费了难以估量的时间后，阿米娅终将回到原点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g6_crownboundary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你发现了，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文明发展的停滞并非意味着原地踏步，时间依旧会在线性的轨迹上不可逆转地向前推进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但生命所创造的和所发现的一切却只会陷入无法脱离的循环。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数学、物理、哲学、神学等各种理论和实践都无法再创造希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向上的螺旋已经失效，生命将在迷失方向的道路上空耗他们的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......这里就已经是边界？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是泰拉目前所能触碰的知识边界。它既是限制，也是保护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保护？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"某种思维认知的保护......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"思维认知？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就像我们没法强迫小沙地兽计算洋流的规律？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"哪怕我们能给出所有的数据和公式......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"硬来依旧会伤害它们的小脑瓜。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的直觉很敏锐，博士，但并非完全准确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"DWDB-221E会启迪生命稳步走向未来，而非简单将未来的碎片展现于求索者的眼前，导致违背自然规律与伦理的演化飞跃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，知识是不可逆转的。瞥见过真实天空的理想家将不再甘愿蒙昧地安眠于大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而超越文明本身思维认知极限的信息，只会变成诱惑他们忽视现实，走向毁灭陷阱的毒药，继而将他们的文明带入深渊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于是，边界诞生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可为什么边界的构成......像是某种庞大的数据服务器组成的监牢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它以你所能接受的形态出现，一如DWDB-221E在物质界以一顶黑色冠冕的形态陪伴着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对渺小的蝼蚁而言，边界可以是一条首尾相连的湍急河流，永远无法汇入大海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而对寿命以万亿年计量的天体而言，边界亦可以是伴随其一生的引力场，不可捉摸，不可逃脱。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你走向了与虚空一步之遥的断面，遥远中心处的“奇点”在吸引着你。\n信息如波浪般轻轻地从你身旁掠过，却足以让你一瞥许多新奇的场景。\n那是属于你过去的浮光掠影——你失去后又遗忘的生活。\n一个“陌生时代”的幻影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，小心！"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅紧张地拉住了你的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没法确认从边界坠下会发生什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些是......你看到的......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......你我思维相通......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......你能看到我所看到的......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——“源石虫的卵鞘”“穿过星星之间的独木桥”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所有那些故事都是真实存在的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"“源石虫的卵鞘”？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"“穿过星星之间的独木桥”？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在很小很小的时候，我遇到了一个很在意的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人明明自己也脆弱得不行，却一定要固执地背着我跨过满是源石碎屑的小径。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我发烧昏昏沉沉，但又害怕噩梦不敢睡觉的时候，那个人也会不厌其烦地给我讲那些我从未听过的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在逼仄黑暗的矿洞里，那个人也会毫不犹豫地砸碎自己好不容易找到的矿石样本——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后把那些发光的小石头嵌在四周的岩壁上，为我讲述星星，还有坐落在云天之上的乐园的故事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，愿意听听那个人讲给我的故事吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"当然。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一个人，总是独自驾驶着像是源石虫卵鞘的神奇载具穿过星星之间的独木桥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在最为幽静的夜晚，也有引路人从上了年纪的星星那里借来发光的云朵，造出圆圆的镜子照亮前路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在独木桥的另一头，尖塔在大气潮汐中若隐若现，还有戴在星星额头上的花环。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当降落在花环上时，会发现那里是一座很大很大的游乐场，而可爱的好孩子们会聚集在那里肆意玩耍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但驾驶载具的人却很难停下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那人会换到一艘最神奇的载具里，驾驶着它驶过漫长的岁月......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而岁月的尽头，却空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只剩自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那是......我？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"为你讲故事的人......是我？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅紧紧地握住了你的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"由于感染的缘故，那时我很难记住很多的东西，我也无法理解故事里的很多东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我会努力去想，尽全力去记住你讲过的每一个故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为那是属于我的故事，是你送给我的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，没想到今天我终于可以把这些你送我的礼物再分享给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，我们已经共同亲眼见证。于我，于你，都重新认识了那段逝去的生活。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"谢谢你，阿米娅......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你会向往那样的生活吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"向往。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也难怪呀。和博士一样，第一次想到那些奇妙的生活时，我也向往过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的生活是我无论如何也没法真正触碰的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会忍不住偷偷和特蕾西娅小姐分享，我们俩会用许多奇怪的想象增添更多的细节——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到它变得面目全非，变得越来越遥不可及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在亲眼瞥见一点点之后，我反而觉得自己和你过去的生活不再那么遥远了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，你相信我们的这片大地终有一天也会如那样美好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"不向往。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我相信。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我们会见到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛会见到的。"}]},{"label":"会有那么一天的。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我们会见到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛会见到的。"}]},{"label":"也许会更好......","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我们会见到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛会见到的。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或许只是不愿意将残酷的另一面分享给你。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许吧。快乐背后的残酷，痛苦背后的喜悦，我们的确都已体验过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我也偷偷向特蕾西娅小姐分享过那些奇妙的故事，她同样为此惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一直渴望着卡兹戴尔......不，是渴望着这片大地的每个人都有机会体验那样的生活。也因此她不断努力着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可不能落后呀，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许终有一天，罗德岛也能在这片大地上见证那样的生活。"}]},{"label":"我始终坚信生活的背面永远存在，阿米娅。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许吧。快乐背后的残酷，痛苦背后的喜悦，我们的确都已体验过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我也偷偷向特蕾西娅小姐分享过那些奇妙的故事，她同样为此惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一直渴望着卡兹戴尔......不，是渴望着这片大地的每个人都有机会体验那样的生活。也因此她不断努力着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可不能落后呀，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许终有一天，罗德岛也能在这片大地上见证那样的生活。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们接下来该怎么做？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“深潜”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"DWDB-221E所储存的完整数据会经由奇点解码并输出合理且合适的信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仅靠阿米娅无法突破其底层逻辑的限制。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......我是特例？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚未可知，但的确存在这样的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那些信息，我们如何接近呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，阿米娅，对此我并无更加有效的资料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我能够不断检索凯尔希所留下的线索，让可能对你们有用的信息在排序上更容易被找到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"也许能搭建一座桥？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桥？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"通向奇点的桥。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"通向知识的桥。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"凯尔希不是已经为我们指引了前路吗？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾有人这么做过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记录中并无先例。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无论如何，值得一试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这其中的风险你们必须知晓，越靠近奇点，信息的密度会越高，你们甚至极有可能体验到信息的质量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信息存在质量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里，它存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"且未完全筛选的信息有概率如洪流般摧毁你们的思维。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而思维湮灭意味着......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"死亡。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g2_rhodeslivingroom_bc"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自内心响起的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）旅者，我只是在目睹又一次毁灭的发生罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自内心响起的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）希尔达，这是你的名字吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在叫我的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无法理解你的语言。而且，你是怎么知道——"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯透过舷窗看到那个深空中的身影慢慢向自己所在的舰船靠近，继而消失在了视野之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屈光者，请问那是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（激烈的歌声）♪——♪——♪——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——您怎么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们很少有人喜欢她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，旅者，我实在无法容忍自己与她共处一室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的其他朋友要是看到了，也会因为这个唾弃我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"当困惑的卡特斯回过神来时，整间舱室中除了她已经空无一人。在预感到某个不受欢迎的人到来之前，所有人都已经提前离开了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然后卡特斯看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必惊讶，我学习过通过远距离共振进行交流的技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，在毁灭那个奇特的种族之前，我保留下了他们进化出的独特语言模式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......毁、毁灭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（叹气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新来的客人，你也对毁灭的行为不齿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......并不清楚发生了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并不复杂，我们的族群曾经以噬星为生。其他人所厌恶的，无非是我们赖以生存的本能而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，如今我们的过往都只是流传于旁人口中的恐怖奇谈罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的族群几近灭绝，恐怕我已经是最后一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我们以毁灭为生，最终当真正的毁灭降临于我们的面前时，我们却无能为力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自那以后，作为苟活者，我已经在几位天才的帮助下改变了摄入生存必要能量的方式——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听上去......您也正试着融入另一种生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以刚刚您在深空中注视着那颗死去的星球，也是在缅怀您所经历的毁灭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缅怀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，并非如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精灵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的每个人都坦然且乐观地接受毁灭追上我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
